WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.753
Tom walked around his lab.

2
00:00:10.754 --> 00:00:13.762
"I must help Tink," he said.

3
00:00:13.763 --> 00:00:16.741
Just then Ann rushed in.

4
00:00:16.742 --> 00:00:21.981
"The king said to come quickly!" Ann said.

5
00:00:21.982 --> 00:00:28.166
Tom and Cat ran outside.

6
00:00:28.167 --> 00:00:37.713
A crowd was gathered at the wall.

7
00:00:37.714 --> 00:00:41.359
Water poured from a crack.

8
00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:45.281
"Tink was looking at that crack!" Tom thought.

9
00:00:45.282 --> 00:00:48.881
"Do something, Tom!" Dirk cried.

10
00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:55.990
"I have an idea," Ann said.

11
00:00:55.991 --> 00:01:01.025
She handed gum to each person. "Chew!"

12
00:01:01.026 --> 00:01:11.432
Everyone chewed.

13
00:01:11.433 --> 00:01:19.620
Cat ran to the Grim Dungeon.

14
00:01:19.621 --> 00:01:23.338
"Now throw your gum at the crack!" Ann said.

15
00:01:23.339 --> 00:01:29.433
Everybody threw.

16
00:01:29.434 --> 00:01:36.995
The gum plugged the crack.

17
00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:39.583
"It's working!" Tom said.

18
00:01:39.584 --> 00:01:42.407
Then all the gum fell off.

19
00:01:42.408 --> 00:01:49.038
The leak got bigger!

20
00:01:49.039 --> 00:01:51.433
"Wizard!" said the king.

21
00:01:51.434 --> 00:01:54.922
"Fix it now!"

22
00:01:54.923 --> 00:01:58.092
Tom pointed his wand at the crack.

23
00:01:58.093 --> 00:02:00.623
"I wish—" Poof!

24
00:02:00.624 --> 00:02:02.410
Fish appeared.

25
00:02:02.411 --> 00:02:06.062
"Oops," Tom said.

26
00:02:06.063 --> 00:02:09.650
"Do something, Wizard," Dirk yelled.

27
00:02:09.651 --> 00:02:16.147
"Or join your friend in the Grim Dungeon!"

28
00:02:16.148 --> 00:02:18.815
Tom closed his eyes.

29
00:02:18.816 --> 00:02:23.553
He waved his wand, and . . .

30
00:02:23.554 --> 00:02:29.264
Tink and Cat appeared!

31
00:02:29.265 --> 00:02:38.236
"I can fix that leak!" Tink said.

32
00:02:38.237 --> 00:02:48.634
Soon water stopped pouring from the crack.

33
00:02:48.635 --> 00:02:52.032
"Tink is a bad jester," said the king.

34
00:02:52.033 --> 00:02:54.650
"But he's a great tinker!"

35
00:02:54.651 --> 00:02:57.536
"Good work, Tom," said Ann.

36
00:02:57.537 --> 00:03:02.908
"You saved the day!"

37
00:03:02.909 --> 00:03:06.649
Tom felt proud.

38
00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:14.137
And so did Cat.

